NAME: 74HC283 (4-Bit Adder)
DESC: 4-bit full adder with fast carry (DIP-16)
CATEGORY: Arithmetic
DIP: 16
VCC: 16
GND: 8

BLOCK: U1 NBIT_ADDER 890 230

WIRE: PIN.5 -> U1.A0
WIRE: PIN.3 -> U1.A1
WIRE: PIN.14 -> U1.A2
WIRE: PIN.12 -> U1.A3
WIRE: PIN.6 -> U1.B0
WIRE: PIN.2 -> U1.B1
WIRE: PIN.15 -> U1.B2
WIRE: PIN.11 -> U1.B3
WIRE: PIN.7 -> U1.Cin
WIRE: U1.S0 -> PIN.4
WIRE: U1.S1 -> PIN.1
WIRE: U1.S2 -> PIN.13
WIRE: U1.S3 -> PIN.10
WIRE: U1.Cout -> PIN.9
